---
import Footer from '../../components/parts/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/parts/Header.astro';
import { absoluteUrl } from '../../lib/site';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const canonical = absoluteUrl('/en/privacy-policy');
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Benito Gonzalez Sax"
  description="Privacy policy for Benito Gonzalez Sax covering contact requests, quote enquiries and website analytics."
  lang="en"
  canonical={canonical}
  alternates={[
    { hreflang: 'en', href: canonical },
    { hreflang: 'es', href: absoluteUrl('/politica-de-privacidad') },
    { hreflang: 'x-default', href: absoluteUrl('/') },
  ]}
>
  <Header />

  <main class="pb-16 pt-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4">
      <h1 class="mb-8 font-segmentA text-6xl uppercase tracking-wide font-bold text-primary md:text-8xl">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-gray-700">
        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 font-segmentA text-4xl uppercase tracking-wide font-bold text-primary md:text-5xl">
            1. Data controller
          </h2>
          <p>
            The data controller is <strong>Benito Gonzalez Garcia</strong>, operating commercially as <strong>Benito Gonzalez Sax</strong>.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Contact email:
            <a href="mailto:info@benitogonzalezsax.com" class="text-primary underline"> info@benitogonzalezsax.com</a><br />
            Phone:
            <a href="tel:+34615977190" class="text-primary underline"> +34 615 97 71 90</a><br />
            Professional address: Mazarron, Murcia, Spain.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 font-segmentA text-4xl uppercase tracking-wide font-bold text-primary md:text-5xl">
            2. Data collected
          </h2>
          <p>
            This website only requests the information needed to answer contact and quote enquiries. That may include name, email,
            phone number, wedding date, city or venue, requested service type and any message submitted by the user.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4">
            The site may also collect basic technical and analytics data to measure website usage and performance.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 font-segmentA text-4xl uppercase tracking-wide font-bold text-primary md:text-5xl">
            3. Purpose of processing
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li>Reply to quote requests and enquiries related to weddings and events.</li>
            <li>Manage follow-up communication by email, phone or WhatsApp when the user starts that conversation.</li>
            <li>Measure and improve the commercial and technical performance of the website.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 font-segmentA text-4xl uppercase tracking-wide font-bold text-primary md:text-5xl">
            4. Legal basis
          </h2>
          <p>
            The legal basis is the user&apos;s consent when submitting a request and, where applicable, the application of pre-contractual measures requested by the user in order to receive information or a quote.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 font-segmentA text-4xl uppercase tracking-wide font-bold text-primary md:text-5xl">
            5. Data retention
          </h2>
          <p>
            Data are kept only for as long as necessary to respond to the request and manage the resulting commercial conversation, unless a longer retention period is required by law.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 font-segmentA text-4xl uppercase tracking-wide font-bold text-primary md:text-5xl">
            6. Recipients and tools
          </h2>
          <p>
            Personal data are not sold or disclosed to unrelated third parties. The website may rely on hosting, analytics and email providers to operate.
            At present, the site uses Google Analytics for measurement and Firebase Hosting for hosting.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 font-segmentA text-4xl uppercase tracking-wide font-bold text-primary md:text-5xl">
            7. Your rights
          </h2>
          <p>
            You may exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure, objection, restriction and portability by emailing
            <a href="mailto:info@benitogonzalezsax.com" class="text-primary underline"> info@benitogonzalezsax.com</a>.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4">
            If you believe that the processing does not comply with the applicable regulations, you may lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 font-segmentA text-4xl uppercase tracking-wide font-bold text-primary md:text-5xl">
            8. Changes to this policy
          </h2>
          <p>
            This privacy policy may be updated to reflect legal, technical or operational changes. The version published on this page will always be the one currently in force.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
